[2026-06-01 07:18:47] [SUBPROCESS] 
[2026-06-01 07:18:47] [SUBPROCESS] — Paprika de frango — disse. — Demora 40 minutos.
[2026-06-01 07:18:47] [SUBPROCESS] 
